1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,293
Sightseeing in the United Kingdom.
英国观光。

2
00:00:05,293 --> 00:00:38,487
After the wedding, my cousin and his wife went to the United Kingdom for nationwide sightseeing. He faxed a letter to me in English yesterday. To my delight, he no longer made any tense error.
婚礼之后，我的表亲和他的妻子到英国各地观光。昨天，他给我传真了一封英文信。让我高兴的是，他不再犯时态错误了。

3
00:00:38,487 --> 00:01:49,480
And his description roughly clarified my questions about the UK--its currency, its administration, the institution which divides it into four constituent countries, and the historical conflicts and quarrels when Southern Ireland broke away from the UK. Unwilling to leave out any attraction, my cousin arranged his enjoyable journey carefully. One attractive place he visited was a castle in the countryside of Scotland, which lies near a port.
他的描述也大致解答了我对英国的疑问——包括英国的货币，行政管理，以及由四个构成国组成的制度，还有历史上的冲突与争端，即南爱尔兰脱离英国时发生的那些事。因为不想遗漏任何景点，我的表亲仔细安排了这次愉快的旅行。他参观的一处迷人景点，是苏格兰乡间的一座城堡，位于一个港口附近。

4
00:01:49,480 --> 00:02:33,673
It used to be the headquarters of the Communism Union but broke down during the war. Finding nothing could take the place of this splendid architecture, people accomplished rebuilding it in 1952. It was to their credit that all furnished rooms are consistent with what they used to be.
它曾经是共产主义联盟的总部，但在战争中毁坏了。人们觉得，没有什么可以替代这座宏伟的建筑，于是于1952年完成了重建。值得称赞的是，所有配备家具的房间都保持着，原来的样子。

5
00:02:33,673 --> 00:03:12,033
My cousin was thrilled by its collections consisting of statues plus royal uniforms folded in glass tanks. Though there was no possibility of buying some of these exhibits, it was convenient to take photos, which he sent me along with his fax.
我的表亲对那里的藏品十分兴奋，包括雕像以及皇家制服，制服被折叠好，放在玻璃柜里。虽然不可能买下其中的一些展品，拍照却很方便，他把照片和传真一起发给了我。
